    <string name="titulo_wifi">Automatic Detection (WiFi)</string>
    <string name="explicacao_wifi">When your phone connects to this WiFi network, it clocks you in automatically; when it disconnects, it clocks you out. This is just a backup — you can still clock in/out manually at any time, even with this on. Automatic times can be off by a few minutes (the time it takes your phone to join the network after you arrive, changing clothes, etc., or to disconnect after you leave), and they\'re always tagged as \"Automatic (WiFi)\" in the records, so they\'re never confused with manual ones.</string>
    <string name="switch_ativar_wifi">Enable automatic detection</string>
