    <string name="aviso_bateria">On some phones (Xiaomi/POCO, Huawei, etc.) the system closes background apps to save battery. If automatic detection stops working on its own, go to Phone Settings → Battery → select Horas → turn off battery saving for this app, and enable \"Autostart\" if that option exists.</string>
